n, the girls decide to play mahjong online.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xSvN9UuiE12zWF8RPcxobyeBfbu.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Mi finiscono i giga!","synopsis":"Nashiko finds herself without internet on her cell phone after using up all her mobile data. So, she contacts her father asking for Wi-Fi to be installed in the store. With the Wi-Fi working, on Riche's recommendation, the girls decide to play mahjong online.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xSvN9UuiE12zWF8RPcxobyeBfbu.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Arriva l'altra","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18043","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"165314","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55397","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"234176","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"435253","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"76755","synopsis":"Riche defeated a strong opponent she met in an online mahjong game. While they were in a celebratory mood, their opponent in question, Emi Haneru, arrives. Immediately upon arriving, Nashiko is initially impressed to see her requesting a rematch with Riche. However, after hearing the words of Riche and her friends, she is inspired. Later, to deepen their friendship with the girl, the group begins a certain strategy...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8ixKXNEPvj54sCqr95T2xG7qoVo.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Arriva l'altra","synopsis":"Riche defeated a strong opponent she met in an online mahjong game. While they were in a celebratory mood, their opponent in question, Emi Haneru, arrives. Immediately upon arriving, Nashiko is initially impressed to see her requesting a rematch with Riche. However, after hearing the words of Riche and her friends, she is inspired. Later, to deepen their friendship with the girl, the group begins a certain strategy...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8ixKXNEPvj54sCqr95T2xG7qoVo.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"In ritiro!","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18043","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"165314","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55397","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"234176","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"435253","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"76907","synopsis":"Mahjong fans organize a one-night stay at an inn in Onomichi to... play mahjong. They also take the opportunity to visit tourist sites in the city that they normally don't have the opportunity to see. Haneru only hopes for one thing: to finally confront Riche and get revenge.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/59xuEH7vcRmuH95cBG7RzFLgmSb.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"In ritiro!","synopsis":"Mahjong fans organize a one-night stay at an inn in Onomichi to... play mahjong. They also take the opportunity to visit tourist sites in the city that they normally don't have the opportunity to see. Haneru only hopes for one thing: to finally confront Riche and get revenge.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/59xuEH7vcRmuH95cBG7RzFLgmSb.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Il primo agosto (Giornata di Pai)","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18043","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"165314","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55397","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"234176","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"435253","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"77104","synopsis":"August 1st is \"Mahjong Day\". On this day, Pai celebrates her birthday, so Nashiko throws a birthday party for her on the beach. The group enjoys a unique birthday party, eating birthday cake on the beach in the middle of the day and playing in the sea. Later, as the party approaches its final stage, Nashiko and the others decide to give Pai a gift. However, right away, Riche presents her with something too expensive to be a gift...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pvi5oYZ1gppD6R5JTZ8cpudJJfP.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Il primo agosto (Giornata di Pai)","synopsis":"August 1st is \"Mahjong Day\". On this day, Pai celebrates her birthday, so Nashiko throws a birthday party for her on the beach. The group enjoys a unique birthday party, eating birthday cake on the beach in the middle of the day and playing in the sea. Later, as the party approaches its final stage, Nashiko and the others decide to give Pai a gift. However, right away, Riche presents her with something too expensive to be a gift...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pvi5oYZ1gppD6R5JTZ8cpudJJfP.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Facciamo luce","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18043","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"165314","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55397","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"234176","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"435253","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"77331","synopsis":"Nashiko's mother invites her to help produce 3,000 paper lamps for the festival of lights, but with only 4 days available she will have to resort to the indispensable help of her friends.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bV8Vs1aRzSeliaUKnrs5bjqyMeu.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Facciamo luce","synopsis":"Nashiko's mother invites her to help produce 3,000 paper lamps for the festival of lights, but with only 4 days available she will have to resort to the indispensable help of her friends.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bV8Vs1aRzSeliaUKnrs5bjqyMeu.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Let's Betcha","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18043","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"165314","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55397","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"234176","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"435253","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"77763","synopsis":"The Becher Festival is a festival where parishioners dressed as demons chase children. One day, as the festival, which represents Onomichi City, draws near, Nashiko and Riche suggest that everyone go around the festival together. However, when Izumi hears this, she collapses. Worried by Nashiko and her friends, Izumi reveals that she was chased by a parishioner as a child and has been traumatized by demons ever since. So, Nashiko and her friends impose a certain training on Izumi in order to help her overcome her demon fears...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3jQF4X9V1jossAiwXtQqehKSRmt.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Let's Betcha","synopsis":"The Becher Festival is a festival where parishioners dressed as demons chase children. One day, as the festival, which represents Onomichi City, draws near, Nashiko and Riche suggest that everyone go around the festival together. However, when Izumi hears this, she collapses. Worried by Nashiko and her friends, Izumi reveals that she was chased by a parishioner as a child and has been traumatized by demons ever since. So, Nashiko and her friends impose a certain training on Izumi in order to help her overcome her demon fears...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3jQF4X9V1jossAiwXtQqehKSRmt.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Buon Natale da tutte noi!","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18043","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"165314","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55397","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"234176","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"435253","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"77909","synopsis":"On December 25th, Nashiko and her friends decide to hold a Christmas party at the former mahjong parlor. On the day of the party, the table is filled with dishes they've all prepared, and everyone enjoys a special mealtime for just one night. Afterward, when they're full, they take a break and play mahjong. Suddenly, during the game, Nashiko, Pai, and Izumi all smile fearlessly. Seeing this, Tobi suspects Nashiko and her friends of cheating, but...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/v6nffPivOx6BsucDan1RESyFuB2.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Buon Natale da tutte noi!","synopsis":"On December 25th, Nashiko and her friends decide to hold a Christmas party at the former mahjong parlor. On the day of the party, the table is filled with dishes they've all prepared, and everyone enjoys a special mealtime for just one night. Afterward, when they're full, they take a break and play mahjong. Suddenly, during the game, Nashiko, Pai, and Izumi all smile fearlessly. Seeing this, Tobi suspects Nashiko and her friends of cheating, but...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/v6nffPivOx6BsucDan1RESyFuB2.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Buon anno!","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18043","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"165314","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55397","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"234176","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"435253","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"78092","synopsis":"On the night of New Year's Eve, Nashiko and her friends gather to visit the shrine for the first time in the new year. After saying their prayers for the new year, the five of them eat soba noodles, draw fortune slips, and have a fun time early in the new year. Two days later, on January 3rd, Nashiko and her friends gather at the former mahjong parlor for their first game of mahjong. They start the game while munching on ozoni made by Nashiko and other dishes that everyone brought. Who will be the first to win in the new year...?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6GX2cGf5f1WDPQZ9Q67T0pEVC2F.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Buon anno!","synopsis":"On the night of New Year's Eve, Nashiko and her friends gather to visit the shrine for the first time in the new year. After saying their prayers for the new year, the five of them eat soba noodles, draw fortune slips, and have a fun time early in the new year. Two days later, on January 3rd, Nashiko and her friends gather at the former mahjong parlor for their first game of mahjong. They start the game while munching on ozoni made by Nashiko and other dishes that everyone brought. Who will be the first to win in the new year...?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6GX2cGf5f1WDPQZ9Q67T0pEVC2F.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Le ragazze del tavolo da mahjong","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18043","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"165314","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55397","episodeNumber